# --- Below: full upstream snap-stanford/Biomni .gitignore, merged in as-is ---
# https://github.com/snap-stanford/Biomni/blob/main/.gitignore
# (kept complete rather than trimmed — unmatched patterns are harmless no-ops,
# and this avoids us guessing at what might matter if a Biomni checkout ever
# sits alongside this template)

